# Secure Mail Console

High deliverability bulk/streaming email engine with Node.js, Express, Nodemailer, and Cloudflare Turnstile integration.

## Features
- SSE (Server-Sent Events) live streaming response
- Spintax variation parsing `{Hi|Hello|Hey}`
- Dynamic tag replacement `{Name}`, `{FirstName}`, `{Email}`, `{Domain}`
- SMTP Port 587 STARTTLS Connection Pooling
- Dual HTML/Plain-text formatting to maximize inbox rate

## Setup
1. Clone the repository
2. Run `npm install`
3. Create `.env` file with `SITE_PASSWORD` and `TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY`
4. Run `npm start`
